# Arc 1.173.1 shows a dragger pill in the drop region's gap while a tab is dragged over the page
# (measured with real drags); Cra hid every divider there and left the gap empty. The pill sits in
# the gap before the region, or after it when the region comes first. Between two panes Arc's
# choice isn't measured; Cra takes the gap before it (SplitDropProposal.pillGap).
budget stalls50=20
pace 0.5
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}

cra://debug?windowSize=1200x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=first
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=middle
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=other
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=shown
wait 1
# A lone page's right edge: the region is second, its gap before it.
cra://debug?dropSplit=n=other&x=0.97&y=0.5
expect-log dropSplit: proposed horizontal 1, region right 0\.(49|50)$
expect-log dropSplit: pill gap 0$
expect-log dropSplit: split horizontal n=shown \| n=other open=n=other shares=0\.50 0\.50$
wait 1
# The first pane's left side: the region comes first, so the gap after it.
cra://debug?dropSplit=n=first&x=0.06&y=0.5
expect-log dropSplit: proposed horizontal 0, region left 0\.3\d$
expect-log dropSplit: pill gap 0$
expect-log dropSplit: split horizontal n=first \| n=shown \| n=other open=n=first shares=0\.33 0\.33 0\.33$
wait 1
# The middle pane's right side: the region between the second and third panes, the gap before it.
cra://debug?dropSplit=n=middle&x=0.64&y=0.5
expect-log dropSplit: proposed horizontal 2, region middle 0\.2\d$
expect-log dropSplit: pill gap 1$
expect-log dropSplit: split horizontal n=first \| n=shown \| n=middle \| n=other open=n=middle shares=0\.25 0\.25 0\.25 0\.25$
